        "collapsible_tab_nhKiAc": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this an eau de toilette or body spray?",
            "icon": "perfume",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely not. Every Aaroma fragrance is a 21% Eau de Parfum, one of the highest concentrations available. </p><p>Most designer brands stop at 10-15%. We go further. What that means for you: it lasts up to 10-12 hours. </p><p>It projects more strongly and lasts longer. You need fewer sprays. It's not a body spray. It's a statement.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_pCrhqV": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do Aaroma's fragrances smell the same as designer fragrances?",
            "icon": "perfume",
            "content": "<p>The same fragrance notes. The same concentration. The same craftsmanship. </p><p>We recreate every fragrance with high-quality oils and a careful blending technique, so yes, it smells exactly like the fragrance that costs five times as much. </p><p>In blind tests, people can't tell them apart. The only difference? You're not paying for a designer logo or a sculpture-shaped glass bottle. </p><p>The luxury is in the scent – and that's exactly what you get.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_gkD4Ei": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is the inspired fragrance different?",
            "icon": "perfume",
            "content": "<p>No — our inspired fragrances are designed as an <strong>exact copy</strong> of the originals from famous luxury brands. We carefully recreate the same fragrance structure, using identical scent notes and raw materials wherever possible.</p><p>✔️ <strong>1:1 fragrance impression</strong> – The scent is virtually indistinguishable from the original, even for experienced perfume lovers.<br/><br/>✔️ <strong>Same longevity and projection</strong> – Thanks to the high concentration of perfume oils (19-21%), our fragrances last just as long as the originals.<br/><br/>✔️ <strong>Affordable price, no compromise</strong> – You get the exact same olfactory experience without paying for the logo, marketing, or designer packaging.</p><p>In short: Our perfumes are identical to luxury brands in scent, quality, and durability — the only difference is the price.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_pdYPYn": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do your fragrances last a long time?",
            "icon": "perfume",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely. More than 12 hours. Every bottle contains a 25% EDP formula that lasts all day – from morning meetings to romantic moments in the middle of the night. One spray, and the scent stays with you all day.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_ydfzCq": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "DISCLAIMER FOR COMPARATIVE ADVERTISING",
            "icon": "star",
            "content": "<p>Please note that the products mentioned on our site serve only as an example and should in no way be confused with the actual products of well-known brands, designer brands or niche brands. </p><p>Names and copyrights, whether used or not, are the property of their respective manufacturers and/or designers. </p><p>These are merely inspirations and they are not 'identical' to other fragrances or original products. </p><p>Aroma fragrances should not be confused with original products and we have no affiliation with the manufacturers.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
