        "review_bLzrA9": {
          "type": "review",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"I'm a big fragrance lover, so I'm picky when it comes to clones, but TryScent completely won me over. I originally ordered the Sauvage clone on the homepage and recognized the scent immediately when I sprayed it. I now own 4 TryScent fragrances in total and I love them. There are 3 more on the way thanks to their bundle offers. If you want something that works on a limited budget and still delivers the performance of a designer brand, I can't recommend them enough.\"</p>",
            "author": "Sean P",
