          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>\"This summer I received a sample set of Creed Aventus as a gift and I really loved it, but I couldn't afford the original. So I looked for dupes. I found Tryscent and ordered \"Pineapple Smoke Vanilla\". It arrived in about a week and it smells really good, close to my original sample. Very happy with the product, especially for the price\"</p>",
